---
import '@fontsource/sora/400.css';
import '@fontsource/sora/600.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" /><title>Keyword Research | NC Digital Admin</title></head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/admin/links/">NC <span>Digital</span><small>/ Keyword Research</small></a><nav aria-label="Admin"><a href="/admin/social/">Social posts</a><a href="/admin/links/">All admin tools ↗</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <div class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">CLIENT RESEARCH · GOOGLE UK</p><h1>Find the searches.<br /><span>Plan the site.</span></h1><p>Turn a service and a town into a practical website plan,<br /> with search data to explain your choices.</p></div><div class="source-status"><span class="status-dot"></span><span id="connection">Checking DataForSEO…</span></div></div>
    <section class="panel search-panel" aria-label="Start keyword research">
      <form id="research-form"><fieldset id="research-fields">
        <label for="query">What does your client do, and where?</label>
        <div class="search-row"><input id="query" name="query" type="text" maxlength="160" required placeholder="e.g. Plumber Merthyr Tydfil" autocomplete="off" /><button id="research-button" class="button primary" disabled type="submit">Research keywords ↗</button></div>
        <div class="search-meta"><button class="example" id="example" type="button">Try: Plumber Merthyr Tydfil</button><span>Google · English · UK search volumes</span></div>
        <details class="options" id="research-options"><summary>Refine the location, services or client website</summary><div class="options-grid">
          <label>Target town or area <span class="hint">Optional if recognised in your search</span><input id="location" list="locations" maxlength="150" placeholder="Start typing a UK town…" autocomplete="off" /><datalist id="locations"></datalist></label>
          <label>Main service <span class="hint">Optional override</span><input id="service" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. plumber" /></label>
          <label>Client website <span class="hint">Optional · check presence in the top 10</span><input id="website" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. clientswebsite.co.uk" /></label>
          <label>Additional services <span class="hint">Optional · up to 10, separated by commas</span><input id="services" maxlength="750" placeholder="e.g. leak repair, bathroom installation" /></label>
        </div></details>
      </fieldset></form>
      <p class="hint cost-note">New research uses your DataForSEO credit. Up to 100 phrases and four API calls per run. Reports are saved; repeat searches reuse results for 7 days.</p>
    </section>
    <div id="notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <section class="saved-bar" aria-label="Saved research"><label for="saved">Saved research</label><select id="saved"><option value="">Choose a previous report…</option></select><button id="load-report" class="button quiet" type="button">Open report</button></section>
    <section id="empty" class="empty-state"><div class="empty-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><h2>A better starting point for every client.</h2><p>Get a shortlist of keywords, a page-by-page plan and a look at who already ranks.</p><div class="feature-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Choose your targets</h3><p>Search volume, organic difficulty, paid CPC and a clear reason for each recommendation.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Map out the website</h3><p>Group related phrases onto sensible pages, with draft titles, headings and content ideas.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>See the evidence</h3><p>Local search results, search trends and Google questions. Export a brief for your project.</p></div></div></section>
    <section id="report" hidden aria-label="Keyword research results">
      <div class="report-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR RESEARCH</p><h2 id="report-title"></h2><p id="report-meta" class="muted"></p></div><div class="report-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="export-csv">Export keywords</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="export-brief">Download brief</button><button type="button" class="button quiet" id="print">Print</button><button type="button" class="button quiet" id="refresh-report">Refresh data</button></div></div>
      <div id="warnings"></div><div id="summary" class="summary-grid"></div>
      <div class="overview-grid"><section id="recommendation" class="panel recommendation"></section><section class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><h3>Search trend</h3><span class="hint">Reported monthly searches · UK</span></div><div id="trend"></div></section></div>
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Research views"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="keywords-panel" id="keywords-tab" data-tab="keywords">Keywords</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" aria-controls="pages-panel" id="pages-tab" data-tab="pages">Website plan</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" aria-controls="competitors-panel" id="competitors-tab" data-tab="competitors">Local competitors</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" aria-controls="questions-panel" id="questions-tab" data-tab="questions">Questions & content</button></div>
      <section id="keywords-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="keywords-tab">
        <div class="table-controls"><label class="sr-only" for="filter">Filter keywords</label><input type="search" id="filter" placeholder="Filter keywords…" /><label class="sr-only" for="scope">Keyword scope</label><select id="scope"><option value="all">All keywords</option><option value="local">Local targets</option><option value="broad">Supporting UK research</option></select><label class="sr-only" for="sort">Sort keywords</label><select id="sort"><option value="priority">Sort: priority</option><option value="volume">Sort: search volume</option><option value="difficulty">Sort: easiest known difficulty</option></select><span id="row-count" class="hint"></span></div>
        <p class="hint table-note">Volumes are UK-wide estimates for the displayed phrase, not searches made only within the town. “—” means unreported, not zero. CPC is in US dollars.</p>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Keyword / recommendation</th><th>Priority</th><th>UK searches / mo</th><th>SEO difficulty / 100</th><th>CPC (USD)</th><th>Ads competition</th><th>Intent</th></tr></thead><tbody id="keyword-rows"></tbody></table></div>
      </section>
      <section id="pages-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pages-tab" hidden><div class="view-intro"><h3>Your starting website plan</h3><p>Keep close keyword variants on one page. These are draft groups, not instructions to create every page. Confirm each service with the client; use real local work and qualifications.</p></div><div id="page-plan" class="page-grid"></div></section>
      <section id="competitors-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="competitors-tab" hidden><div id="competitor-intro" class="view-intro"></div><div id="competitors" class="competitor-list"></div></section>
      <section id="questions-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="questions-tab" hidden><div id="questions"></div></section>
      <details class="methodology panel"><summary>Where the data comes from & how priorities are chosen</summary><p id="methodology"></p><p>Volumes and difficulty come from DataForSEO’s keyword database and can lag behind today. The competitor snapshot is a new Google search from the selected location. A low or missing volume does not prove that a service has no customers. Similar keywords may share search demand, so we do not add them into a traffic forecast.</p><p>“Primary target” means a direct service and town match. “Opportunity” means a related local phrase has reported demand. “Validate with client” means the service or demand needs confirmation. Inferred intent and page groups are labelled separately from provider metrics.</p><p><a href="https://docs.dataforseo.com/v3/dataforseo_labs/google/keyword_overview/live/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Keyword metric definitions ↗</a> · <a href="https://docs.dataforseo.com/v3/serp/google/organic/live/advanced/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Local search result source ↗</a></p></details>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>import '../../scripts/keyword-research.js';</script>
</body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  :root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;color:#eeedf5;background:#0c0c13;font-synthesis:none}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}button,input,select{font:inherit}a{color:#bea2ff;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}[hidden]{display:none!important}:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c3a5ff;outline-offset:4px}input,select{min-width:0;background:#0c0c14;border:1px solid #3b354b;color:#f0eaf8;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;font-size:12px}input::placeholder{color:#8e889d}fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0}label{font-size:12px;display:block}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}p{line-height:1.8}h2{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.04em}h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}.topbar{min-height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:20px 4vw;border-bottom:1px solid #282433}.brand{font-size:20px;color:white;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}.brand span{color:#a984ff}.brand small{font-size:12px;color:#a6a0b4;margin-left:14px;font-weight:400}.topbar nav{display:flex;gap:25px;font-size:12px}main{max-width:1420px;margin:auto;padding:48px 32px 80px}.intro{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:600;color:#b59ae9;margin:0 0 14px}h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.13;margin:0 0 18px}h1 span{color:#b499e7}.intro p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;color:#aba5b9;margin-bottom:0}.source-status{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:#b6adc7;white-space:nowrap;padding-bottom:5px}.status-dot{height:6px;width:6px;background:#b098da;border-radius:50%}.panel{background:#14121e;border:1px solid #30293f;border-radius:12px;padding:26px}.search-panel{border-color:#4a385f;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#1d162b,#14121e 70%)}.search-panel>form>fieldset>label{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px}.search-row{display:flex;gap:12px}.search-row input{flex:1;font-size:16px;padding:17px 18px}.button{border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;line-height:1.4}.primary{color:#17101f;background:#bfa0f0;font-size:13px;padding:17px 24px}.primary:hover{background:#ceb3f6}.secondary{color:#d7c5ee;background:#211a2e;border-color:#49365e}.quiet{background:transparent;color:#c0b6d0;border-color:#393142}.search-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:14px 0;font-size:10px;color:#a49bae}.example{border:0;background:transparent;color:#c8acf1;font-size:10px;padding:0}.options{border-top:1px solid #34293f;padding-top:16px;margin-top:18px}summary{cursor:pointer;color:#bfb2cf;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8}.options-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:22px}.options-grid label{display:grid;gap:9px}.hint,.muted{color:#a49bb3;font-size:10px;line-height:1.7}.cost-note{margin:18px 0 0}.notice{border:1px solid #5d4575;background:#241a32;color:#e0cef4;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;margin:20px 0;line-height:1.8}.notice.error{border-color:#8a5158;background:#301b22;color:#ffd1d4}.notice.warn{border-color:#785b31;background:#292318;color:#edd3a3}.notice.loading::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border:2px solid #a386c2;border-top-color:transparent;border-radius:50%;margin-right:12px;animation:spin 1s linear infinite}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}.saved-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:23px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #282432}.saved-bar label{font-size:11px;color:#b7afc4}.saved-bar select{flex:1;max-width:440px;font-size:11px}.empty-state{text-align:center;padding:55px 20px 0}.empty-symbol{width:45px;height:45px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 18px;background:#241a34;border:1px solid #4c3469;color:#c3a0f3;border-radius:12px;font-size:23px}.empty-state h2{font-size:23px}.empty-state>p{font-size:12px;color:#a59bad}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:45px;text-align:left;max-width:990px;margin:42px auto 0}.feature-grid>div{border-top:1px solid #3b2c4c;padding-top:20px}.feature-grid span{font-size:10px;color:#aa89d4}.feature-grid h3{margin:12px 0 10px}.feature-grid p{font-size:11px;color:#9d93aa}.report-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin:35px 0 22px}.report-heading h2{margin-bottom:8px}.report-heading .eyebrow{margin-bottom:8px}.report-heading p{margin-bottom:0}.report-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px;margin-bottom:18px}.stat{border:1px solid #31283f;background:#14111e;border-radius:10px;padding:20px}.stat span{font-size:10px;color:#aa9fb9;display:block}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 5px}.stat small{font-size:9px;color:#ac9eba}.overview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-bottom:30px}.recommendation p{font-size:11px;color:#bab0c8}.recommendation .eyebrow{font-size:9px}.recommendation .keyword-main{font-size:22px;color:#f1e9fc;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:13px}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-heading h3{margin-bottom:4px}.trend-title{font-size:11px;color:#bfb0ce;margin:10px 0}.chart{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end;height:115px;border-bottom:1px solid #3e334d;margin:15px 0 8px}.chart-col{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;height:100%}.chart-bar{width:100%;min-height:2px;background:#ae8bda;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0}.chart-bar.missing{background:transparent;border:1px dashed #665570}.chart-labels{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:8px;color:#b3a4c2}.chart-labels span{flex:1;text-align:center;min-width:0}.tabs{display:flex;gap:28px;border-bottom:1px solid #3b2c4d;margin-bottom:22px}.tabs button{color:#aaa0b6;background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;padding:14px 0;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}.tabs button[aria-selected=true]{border-bottom-color:#c2a0f3;color:#dcc4fc}.table-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}.table-controls input{flex:1;max-width:320px}.table-controls select{font-size:10px}.table-controls .hint{margin-left:auto}.table-note{margin:13px 0}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #30283f;border-radius:10px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;text-align:left}th{background:#1b1526;color:#bcb0cb;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;padding:15px 13px;white-space:nowrap}td{padding:17px 13px;border-top:1px solid #292134;vertical-align:top}td:first-child{min-width:265px;max-width:400px}td:not(:first-child){white-space:nowrap}td strong{font-weight:400;color:#ece2f9}td small{display:block;color:#9689a6;font-size:9px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:5px;white-space:normal}tr:hover td{background:#171221}.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;border:1px solid #50405e;color:#c7abdf;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:5px}.badge.primary-target{background:#292036;border-color:#785697;color:#e1c4fb}.badge.opportunity{border-color:#426454;color:#a6d8b8}.badge.validate-with-client{border-color:#705b3a;color:#dbc095}.view-intro{margin:6px 0 22px}.view-intro h3{font-size:19px}.view-intro p{font-size:12px;color:#b3a8c0;max-width:960px}.page-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.page-card h3{font-size:18px;margin:12px 0}.page-card .path{font-size:10px;color:#ad8dd1;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.page-card p,.page-card li{font-size:11px;color:#b6a9c3;line-height:1.9}.page-card dl{font-size:11px;margin-top:20px}.page-card dt{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9d8cae;margin:15px 0 6px}.page-card dd{margin:0;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.page-card details{margin:16px 0}.page-card ul{padding-left:16px}.supporting-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.supporting-tags span{font-size:9px;border-radius:4px;padding:5px 7px;background:#21192e;color:#bfadce}.competitor-list{display:grid;gap:12px}.competitor{display:flex;gap:20px;padding:22px}.rank{font-size:22px;color:#ad88d2;min-width:32px}.competitor h3{margin:5px 0 7px}.competitor small{font-size:10px;color:#b2a1c2}.competitor p{font-size:11px;color:#a99cb5;margin-bottom:0}.competitor a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.question-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.question-grid li{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:12px;color:#c4b7d1}.question-grid ul{padding-left:18px}.question-grid p{font-size:11px;color:#a89ab6}.methodology{margin-top:30px;padding:20px}.methodology p{font-size:11px;color:#b0a2bf;margin:18px 0 0}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}.no-results{padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#b4a7c2}.trend-select{border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;color:#d5bbf2;font-size:11px;text-align:left}.trend-select:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:900px){main{padding:32px 20px 60px}.intro{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.overview-grid,.page-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.summary-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.report-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.table-controls{flex-wrap:wrap}.table-controls input{max-width:none}.table-controls .hint{margin-left:0}.tabs{gap:22px;overflow-x:auto}.brand small{display:none}.topbar nav{gap:14px}.feature-grid{gap:20px}.section-heading{flex-wrap:wrap}}
  @media(max-width:550px){main{padding:28px 14px 50px}.topbar{padding:18px 16px}.topbar nav a:first-child{display:none}.panel{padding:20px}.search-row{flex-direction:column}.search-row input{font-size:14px}.search-meta{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.options-grid,.question-grid,.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.saved-bar{flex-wrap:wrap}.saved-bar label{width:100%}.saved-bar select{width:180px}.empty-state{padding:35px 5px}.feature-grid{margin-top:28px;gap:12px}.feature-grid p{margin-bottom:0}.stat{padding:15px}.stat strong{font-size:24px}.table-controls select{flex:1}.table-controls input{width:100%;flex-basis:100%}.tabs{gap:24px}.tabs button{font-size:11px}.competitor{padding:18px;gap:12px}.report-actions .button{padding:10px}.chart{gap:5px}.chart-labels{gap:5px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.notice.loading::before{animation:none}}
  @media print{:root{color-scheme:light;background:white;color:#111}body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.topbar,.intro,.search-panel,.saved-bar,.report-actions,.tabs,.table-controls,#notice,#empty{display:none!important}main{padding:0;max-width:none}#report:not([hidden]) [role=tabpanel][hidden]{display:block!important}.panel,.stat,th,td,.badge{background:white!important;color:#222!important;border-color:#bbb!important}.page-grid,.overview-grid,.question-grid{display:block}.page-card,.competitor,.stat{break-inside:avoid}.panel{margin:15px 0}.table-wrap{overflow:visible}table{font-size:9px}td:first-child{min-width:160px}td,th{padding:8px}a,p,small,.muted,.hint{color:#444!important}.keyword-main{color:#111!important}.view-intro{margin-top:30px}.chart-bar{print-color-adjust:exact}}
</style>
